OL,3,APossible wreckage of Amelia Earhart's
OL,4,Aplane likely to be trees, say
OL,5,Aresearchers
OL,6,
OL,7,FResearches looking at what they thought
OL,8,Fcould have been the wreckage of Amelia
OL,9,FEarhart's plane on a remote Pacific
OL,10,Fisland say it is likely to be washed up
OL,11,Ftrees.
OL,13,FThe team travelled to a lagoon in the
OL,14,FTaraia Peninsula on Nikumaroro,
OL,15,FKiribati, to confirm whether a shiny
OL,16,Fobject first spotted on satellite
OL,17,Fimagery in 2020 solved the decades-long
OL,18,Fmystery of the pioneering pilot's
OL,19,Fdisappearance.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
